Package: flreefs
Title: Florida Artificial Reef Deployment Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Rob", "Wiederstein", , "khuon68@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A cleaned snapshot of artificial reef deployment records
    published by the Florida Fish and Wildlife Conservation Commission
    (FWC), with one row per deployment. Also provides a function to
    download and clean the latest data directly from FWC.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
